# Per-file carve-outs: paths the private-repo rule flags that cannot take
# inline `# guard:allow` markers (see reason per entry). The gitleaks gate
# still scans these files. Globs (not literals) where the filename itself
# contains the term — the guard scans this file too. Re-check if guard terms
# are ever scoped (WAVE-27328).
# AGENTS.md: machine-surface fence must stay byte-exact (hyphen-boundary FP).
AGENTS.md
# capabilities.json: own public name self-references; json takes no markers.
capabilities.json
# package.json: own public name self-references; json takes no markers.
package.json
# bin/*.mjs: own public name in JS code (no # comments available).
bin/*.mjs
# test/*.mjs: own public name in JS code (no # comments available).
test/*.mjs
# provenance schema: $id must name its home repo (own public name).
.buildkite/provenance/schema/provenance.schema.json
